ZThis "request to play" is generated by the player process "search".
Z"search" will look after a file /tmp/SEARCH. If it doesn't exist, "search"
Zwill start the deamon "searchd".
Z
ZInstallation instructions:
Z
Z1.  If search is being installed by a non-superuser you will have to
Zmake a few changes to the procedure below.  You must change the path
Znames of the game and score file to something appropriate.
ZSee the variables LIBDIR, OWNER, GROUP and ROOT in the Makefile.
